WEBVTT

00:06:57.065 --> 00:07:00.535
(Applause)

00:07:02.435 --> 00:07:04.245
I keep reading, I keep following you

00:07:04.245 --> 00:07:06.445
and I find that you 
keep coming back to India,

00:07:06.445 --> 00:07:08.495
visiting the villages here

00:07:08.495 --> 00:07:11.725
and other townships 
and keep on trying to find out

00:07:11.725 --> 00:07:15.525
how technology will have
a profound effect

00:07:15.525 --> 00:07:17.505
on the course of future India.

00:07:17.505 --> 00:07:22.985
I would like to ask you, what you
and your company are doing on that front.

00:07:24.105 --> 00:07:26.935
One of the things I'm really excited by

00:07:26.935 --> 00:07:32.505
is giving everyone in India one day
a chance to carry a smartphone